Package: GoogolGame
Type: Package
Title: A Shiny Implementation of the Googol Game
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "David", "Cleve",
      email = "david.cleve@student.uva.nl",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: A Shiny implementation of the Googol Game. One player
    enters a sequence of numbers and the other sees them one at a time,
    deciding at each step whether to select the current number or continue.
    The goal is to select the highest number in the sequence. Alternatively, 
    players can choose to generate numbers randomly.
